    turn, if this card has "Crystal God Tistina" as material: You can detach 1 material
    from this card; it gains 2000 ATK until the end of your opponent''s turn. If
    this card you control is destroyed by an opponent''s card while it has material:
    You can Special Summon 1 "Tistina" monster from your GY.'
